      "content": "Under CIF Incoterms 2020, the seller is responsible for delivering the goods to the named port of destination in Germany. This includes paying for the cost of the goods, insurance, and freight up to that point. Crucially, the risk of loss or damage transfers from the seller to the buyer once the goods are loaded onto the vessel in South Korea.",
