    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok thanks. so if the goods get damaged during the ocean transit, even though the risk transferred once they were loaded, who actually handles the insurance claim process? do i need to contact the seller or the insurance company directly? i just want to make sure i don't miss any steps if something goes wrong during the voyage.",
