      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so i'll basically be tied to the paperwork the seller gives me. what kind of specific documents should i be looking for to ensure the insurance is valid and covers the full value of the components? i want to be really thorough so there aren't any loopholes for the carrier or insurer to use to avoid paying out.",
